@Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Health Check
GET {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/health

### Inference
POST {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt2",
  "inputs": "The quick brown fox",
  "parameters": {
    "max_new_tokens": 50,
    "temperature": 0.7
  }
}
